---
/* ============================================================
   Listing â€” ink band, two-up blocks, tallest tier first
   ------------------------------------------------------------
   OPEN-QUESTIONS.md #5 guessed this would be the homepage's 704/464
   grid, repeated and alternated. The export answered differently: one
   full-width row per project, `gap-16` between them, each row shorter
   than the last â€” 560 (featured) â†’ 400 (medium) â†’ 265 (small, the same
   height the homepage's own small cards use). See OPEN-QUESTIONS.md #18.

   TWO COLUMNS FROM 900px, at the user's direction â€” ten full-width rows
   read as one endless strip on a desktop. See OPEN-QUESTIONS.md #26.
   The tier heights are the export's; only the widths changed. The
   featured card and the pipeline panel span both columns. Below 900px
   (the same step as the homepage grid, DESIGN-SYSTEM Â§10) it is the
   export's single column again.

   ODD ONE OUT. A tier with an odd number of visible cards widens its
   last one across both columns (`data-wide`), so a medium card never
   sits beside an empty cell or a shorter small card. The server renders
   that for the unfiltered list; Filters.astro recomputes it whenever a
   tab hides cards. `data-project-tier` is how it finds each tier.

   Media rules are unchanged from DESIGN-SYSTEM Â§5 regardless of tier:
   full-bleed, always scrimmed, square corners, no frame, caption at
   the foot of the box, 32px in on the two larger tiers and 20px on the
   small one.

   STATUS BADGE vs DISCIPLINE BADGE. Two different things share the
   corner of a card and must not be confused:
     Â· discipline badges ("Civil", "Mechanical") are the existing teal
       chip from DESIGN-SYSTEM Â§7, bottom-left, with the caption.
     Â· a status badge ("Live", "Live â€” 85%+ Complete") is new â€” this
       design has no prior "is this still going" marker. Built solid
       `bg-kd-mint` / `text-kd-ink-deep`, top-left, away from the
       caption block, so the two badge kinds never compete for the same
       corner. Only carried by projects where `live` is true; see the
       note on ProjectEntry.statusBadge in src/data/projects.ts.

   EVERY PHOTO CARD CARRIES `data-project-status`. Filters.astro reads
   it to decide what "Live" / "Completed" shows. The pipeline panel at
   the foot of the band is not a project and carries neither the
   attribute nor a status badge â€” it is always visible.

   EVERY CARD LINKS TO ITS OWN PAGE â€” see OPEN-QUESTIONS.md #21. A
   plain `<a class="absolute inset-0">` as the last child of each
   `<article>` rather than wrapping the article in an `<a>`: nothing
   inside a card is itself interactive, so a single stretched link
   makes the whole card clickable without changing the article's
   sizing or its `position: relative` stacking context. `aria-label`
   carries the project name since the link covers, rather than wraps,
   the visible title text.

   `data-listing-view` on the band is how Filters.astro's Gallery tab
   swaps this band for projects/Gallery.astro and back.

   STEEL FABRICATION & ERECTION (OPEN-QUESTIONS.md #31). Every card whose
   project the source doc gives structural steel for carries
   `data-project-steel`, which is all the "Steel Fabrication & Erection"
   tab reads. Two entries follow the small tier, both full width:
     Â· the Vindhane plant â€” a medium-height photo card built exactly as
       the medium tier is, linking to its own page, /resources/vindhane-plant
       (OPEN-QUESTIONS.md #33);
     Â· the steel ledger â€” the pipeline panel's stat-tile fill, one row
       per project with its tonnage, each row linking to that project.
   Both carry `data-project-status="steel"`, so they show under All and
   the steel tab and hide under Live and Completed, where a plant and a
   tonnage total are not a status.
   ============================================================ */
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import featuredImg from "../../assets/about-mankhurd-workforce.jpg";
import matungaImg from "../../assets/project-matunga-workshop.jpg";
import nhavaShevaUranImg from "../../assets/project-nhava-sheva-uran.jpg";
import harbourFobImg from "../../assets/project-fob-truss-span.jpg";
import harbourRedevImg from "../../assets/project-harbour-redevelopment-progress.jpg";
import sanpadaImg from "../../assets/project-sanpada-carshed.jpg";
import matungaFobImg from "../../assets/gallery/matunga-workshop-fob-01.jpg";
import solapurImg from "../../assets/project-solapur-vande-bharat.jpg";
import lowerParelImg from "../../assets/project-lower-parel.jpg";
import matungaLhbImg from "../../assets/project-matunga-lhb.jpg";
import vindhanePlantImg from "../../assets/project-vindhane-plant.jpg";
import { projects } from "../../data/projects";
import { slugify } from "../../lib/slug";
import Arrow from "../Arrow.astro";

const { listing } = projects;
const { plant, ledger } = listing.steel;
/* Positionally paired with listing.medium / listing.small â€” see
   OPEN-QUESTIONS.md #19b for what each image actually shows and why. */
const mediumImages = [
  matungaImg,
  nhavaShevaUranImg,
  harbourFobImg,
  harbourRedevImg,
  matungaLhbImg,
];
const smallImages = [sanpadaImg, matungaFobImg, solapurImg, lowerParelImg];
/* Medium and small images are cut at 2Ã— their one-column desktop box
   (584px wide), not as 1184px-wide strips that a 584px box would crop
   down to a sliver. */

/* `undefined`, not `false`: Astro writes `data-wide="false"`, and the
   `data-wide:` variant matches on the attribute being there at all. */
const isOddOneOut = (i: number, count: number) =>
  count % 2 === 1 && i === count - 1 ? true : undefined;
---

<section class="bg-kd-ink py-96" data-listing-view>
  <div class="max-w-kd mx-auto px-48 grid grid-cols-1 min-[900px]:grid-cols-2 gap-16">
    <article
      class="relative h-560 overflow-hidden min-[900px]:col-span-2"
      data-project-status={listing.featured.live ? "live" : "completed"}
      data-project-steel={listing.featured.steel}
    >
      <Image
        src={featuredImg}
        alt={listing.featured.alt}
        width={1184}
        height={560}
        loading="eager"
        class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover object-center"
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-image: var(--kd-scrim-lg)" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      {listing.featured.statusBadge && (
        <span
          class="inline-block absolute left-24 top-24 text-badge uppercase text-kd-ink-deep bg-kd-mint px-12 py-6"
          data-edit="projects.listing.featured.statusBadge"
        >
          {listing.featured.statusBadge}
        </span>
      )}

      <div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 p-32">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-8">
          {listing.featured.badges.map((badge, i) => (
            <span
              class="inline-block text-badge uppercase text-kd-mist bg-kd-badge-fill border border-kd-badge-border px-8 py-6"
              data-edit={`projects.listing.featured.badges.${i}`}
            >
              {badge}
            </span>
          ))}
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-d6 text-kd-mist mt-12" data-edit="projects.listing.featured.title">
          {listing.featured.title}
        </h3>
        <p class="text-meta text-kd-fog mt-6" data-edit="projects.listing.featured.meta">
          {listing.featured.meta}
        </p>
        <p class="text-body-sm text-kd-mist mt-16 max-w-560" data-edit="projects.listing.featured.body">
          {listing.featured.body}
        </p>
        <p class="text-meta-sm text-kd-fog mt-12" data-edit="projects.listing.featured.footnote">
          {listing.featured.footnote}
        </p>
      </div>

      <a
        href={`/projects/${slugify(listing.featured.title)}`}
        class="absolute inset-0"
        aria-label={listing.featured.title}
      />
    </article>

    {
      listing.medium.map((project, i) => (
        <article
          class="relative h-400 overflow-hidden min-[900px]:data-wide:col-span-2"
          data-project-status={project.live ? "live" : "completed"}
          data-project-steel={project.steel}
          data-project-tier="medium"
          data-wide={isOddOneOut(i, listing.medium.length)}
        >
          <Image
            src={mediumImages[i]}
            alt={project.alt}
            width={1168}
            height={800}
            loading="lazy"
            class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover object-center"
          />
          <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-image: var(--kd-scrim-lg)" aria-hidden="true" />

          {project.statusBadge && (
            <span
              class="inline-block absolute left-24 top-24 text-badge-sm uppercase text-kd-ink-deep bg-kd-mint px-8 py-6"
              data-edit={`projects.listing.medium.${i}.statusBadge`}
            >
              {project.statusBadge}
            </span>
          )}

          <div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 p-32">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-8">
              {project.badges.map((badge, j) => (
                <span
                  class="inline-block text-badge uppercase text-kd-mist bg-kd-badge-fill border border-kd-badge-border px-8 py-6"
                  data-edit={`projects.listing.medium.${i}.badges.${j}`}
                >
                  {badge}
                </span>
              ))}
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-display text-d6 text-kd-mist mt-12" data-edit={`projects.listing.medium.${i}.title`}>
              {project.title}
            </h3>
            <p class="text-meta text-kd-fog mt-6" data-edit={`projects.listing.medium.${i}.meta`}>
              {project.meta}
            </p>
          </div>

          <a
            href={`/projects/${slugify(project.title)}`}
            class="absolute inset-0"
            aria-label={project.title}
          />
        </article>
      ))
    }

    {
      listing.small.map((project, i) => (
        <article
          class="relative h-265 overflow-hidden min-[900px]:data-wide:col-span-2"
          data-project-status={project.live ? "live" : "completed"}
          data-project-steel={project.steel}
          data-project-tier="small"
          data-wide={isOddOneOut(i, listing.small.length)}
        >
          <Image
            src={smallImages[i]}
            alt={project.alt}
            width={1168}
            height={530}
            loading="lazy"
            class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover object-center"
          />
          <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-image: var(--kd-scrim-sm)" aria-hidden="true" />
          <div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 p-20">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-6">
              {project.badges.map((badge, j) => (
                <span
                  class="inline-block text-badge-sm uppercase text-kd-mist bg-kd-badge-fill border border-kd-badge-border px-8 py-6"
                  data-edit={`projects.listing.small.${i}.badges.${j}`}
                >
                  {badge}
                </span>
              ))}
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-display text-d9 text-kd-mist mt-8" data-edit={`projects.listing.small.${i}.title`}>
              {project.title}
            </h3>
            <p class="text-meta-sm text-kd-fog mt-6" data-edit={`projects.listing.small.${i}.meta`}>
              {project.meta}
            </p>
          </div>

          <a
            href={`/projects/${slugify(project.title)}`}
            class="absolute inset-0"
            aria-label={project.title}
          />
        </article>
      ))
    }

    <!-- 560px below 900px, the featured card's height: at phone width the
         caption runs five lines, and at 400px it climbs onto the photograph's
         white sky, where no scrim reaches. -->
    <article
      class="relative h-560 min-[900px]:h-400 overflow-hidden min-[900px]:col-span-2"
      data-project-status="steel"
      data-project-steel
    >
      <Image
        src={vindhanePlantImg}
        alt={plant.alt}
        width={1600}
        height={540}
        loading="lazy"
        class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover object-center"
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-image: var(--kd-scrim-lg)" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 p-32">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-8">
          <span
            class="inline-block text-badge uppercase text-kd-mist bg-kd-badge-fill border border-kd-badge-border px-8 py-6"
            data-edit="projects.listing.steel.plant.badge"
          >
            {plant.badge}
          </span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-d6 text-kd-mist mt-12" data-edit="projects.listing.steel.plant.title">
          {plant.title}
        </h3>
        <p class="text-meta text-kd-fog mt-6" data-edit="projects.listing.steel.plant.meta">
          {plant.meta}
        </p>
        <p class="text-body-sm text-kd-mist mt-16 max-w-560" data-edit="projects.listing.steel.plant.body">
          {plant.body}
        </p>
      </div>

      <a href="/resources/vindhane-plant" class="absolute inset-0" aria-label={plant.title}></a>
    </article>

    <div
      class="bg-kd-stat-fill border border-kd-stat-border p-32 min-[900px]:col-span-2"
      data-project-status="steel"
      data-project-steel
    >
      <span class="text-kicker uppercase text-kd-mint" data-edit="projects.listing.steel.ledger.kicker">
        {ledger.kicker}
      </span>
      <p class="font-display text-d3 text-kd-mint mt-16" data-edit="projects.listing.steel.ledger.value">
        {ledger.value}
      </p>
      <p class="text-body-sm text-kd-fog mt-12 max-w-560" data-edit="projects.listing.steel.ledger.body">
        {ledger.body}
      </p>
      <ul class="grid grid-cols-1 min-[900px]:grid-cols-2 gap-x-32 mt-32">
        {ledger.items.map((row, i) => (
          <li class="border-t border-t-kd-stat-border">
            <a
              href={`/projects/${slugify(row.title)}`}
              class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-16 py-16"
            >
              <span class="flex flex-col">
                <span class="text-ui text-kd-mist" data-edit={`projects.listing.steel.ledger.items.${i}.title`}>
                  {row.title}
                </span>
                <span class="text-meta-sm text-kd-fog mt-6" data-edit={`projects.listing.steel.ledger.items.${i}.label`}>
                  {row.label}
                </span>
              </span>
              <span
                class="font-display text-d8 text-kd-mint shrink-0"
                data-edit={`projects.listing.steel.ledger.items.${i}.figure`}
              >
                {row.figure}
              </span>
            </a>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-kd-stat-fill border border-kd-stat-border p-32 min-[900px]:col-span-2">
      <span class="text-kicker uppercase text-kd-mint" data-edit="projects.listing.pipeline.kicker">
        {listing.pipeline.kicker}
      </span>
      <p class="font-display text-d3 text-kd-mint mt-16" data-edit="projects.listing.pipeline.value">
        {listing.pipeline.value}
      </p>
      <p class="text-body-sm text-kd-fog mt-12 max-w-560" data-edit="projects.listing.pipeline.body">
        {listing.pipeline.body}
      </p>
      <a
        href={listing.pipeline.link.href}
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-8 text-ui text-kd-mint mt-24"
      >
        <span data-edit="projects.listing.pipeline.link.label">{listing.pipeline.link.label}</span>
        <Arrow />
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
